     "title": "The Battle Over North Sea Oil Is Heating Up Under Britain’s New PM",
     "url": "https://oilprice.com/Energy/Energy-General/The-Battle-Over-North-Sea-Oil-Is-Heating-Up-Under-Britains-New-PM.html",
     "time": "08-16 03:00",
