     "title": "SanDisk CEO reveals what's next after explosive 3,150% stock rally",
     "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/sandisk-ceo-reveals-whats-next-013700105.html",
     "time": "08-15 09:37",
