     "content": "Eton stock catapulted to a record high Friday after the biotech company smashed second-quarter sales forecasts and hiked its guidance for the year. The company sells treatments for rare diseases and pediatric endocrinology. During the June quarter, Eton Pharmaceuticals (ETON) generated $37.6 million in sales. Sales skyrocketed 99% and handily beat expectations for $27.1 million, according to FactSet. That led…\nWhy Top 3% Biotech Stock, Eton, Just Catapulted To A Record High\nCopyright ©2026 Investor's Business Daily, LLC. All rights reserved. 87990cbe856818d5eddac44c7b1cdeb8",
